{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04227","headline":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋月 · 骆宾王","name":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云披玉绳净，月满镜轮圆。\n裛露珠晖冷，凌霜桂影寒。\n漏彩含疎薄，浮光漾急澜。\n西园徒自赏，南飞终未安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}